3. THE KEEPER'S ARITHMETIC (apply_gen_sch_a_hotr1.py)
  v33_min          3.2        BOUND    board A's +3V3 at its low end (TPS62933, 3.3 V from 31.6k/10k); the keeper is judged at 3.2 V
  voh_drop         0.2        MAKER    SN74LVC08A VOH at least VCC - 0.2 V at IOH -100 uA, 2.7 to 3.6 V (TI SCAS283W)
  vol              0.2        MAKER    SN74LVC08A VOL at most 0.2 V at IOL 100 uA (TI SCAS283W)
  rk               4700       BOUND    the keeper's feedback resistor R230 to R232, 4.7 k
  rpd_min          50000      MAKER    RP2040 pad pull-down RPD 50 to 80 kOhm (RP2040 datasheet Table 625); the reset state of every pad, PDE 0x1 (2.19.6.3)
  rpd_max          80000      MAKER    the same row's maximum
  rpull            100000     MAKER    R30, R34, R38, 100 k to GND (gen_sch_a.py)
  ien_bound        2e-05      INFERRED the enable pins' current, SOURCED by both parts (AP64500: an internal 1.5 uA pull-up source, IEN 1 to 2 uA at 1 V and 5.5 uA typical at 1.5 V, Diodes DS41979 Rev 5-2; LM5176: IEN(STBY) 1 to 3 uA at 1.1 V, the hysteresis current 2.15 to 4.25 uA at 1.5 V, TI SNVSAI1D); no figure at the held levels; bounded at 20 uA and taken in the direction that is worse for each level
  vih              2          MAKER    VIH 2.0 V: SN74LVC08A at 2.7 to 3.6 V (SCAS283W) and the RP2040 at IOVDD 3.3 V (Table 625)
  vil              0.8        MAKER    VIL 0.8 V: the same two rows
  ap_ven_h_max     1.25       MAKER    AP64500 VEN_H at most 1.25 V (DS41979)
  ap_ven_l_min     1.03       MAKER    AP64500 VEN_L at least 1.03 V (DS41979)
  lm_ven_op_max    1.29       MAKER    LM5176 VEN(OP) rising at most 1.29 V (TI SNVSAI1D)
  lm_ven_stby_min  0.55       MAKER    LM5176 VEN(STBY) at least 0.55 V (TI SNVSAI1D)
  rp_voh_min       2.62       MAKER    RP2040 VOH at least 2.62 V at IOVDD 3.3 V, IOH 2, 4, 8 or 12 mA (Table 625)
  rp_vol_max       0.5        MAKER    RP2040 VOL at most 0.5 V at IOVDD 3.3 V, IOL 2, 4, 8 or 12 mA (Table 625)
  rp_drive_ma      4          MAKER    the pad's default drive, DRIVE reset 0x1 = 4 mA (RP2040 datasheet 2.19.6.3)
  v33_nom          3.3        MAKER    the panel's IOVDD and board A's +3V3 nominal
  with rpd_min: pad pull-down in parallel with the 100 k = 33.33 k, the line's resistance 4.12 k; held HIGH 2.547 V (divider 2.629 V less 20 uA's drop); held LOW 0.258 V (divider 0.175 V plus 20 uA's rise)
  with rpd_max: pad pull-down in parallel with the 100 k = 44.44 k, the line's resistance 4.25 k; held HIGH 2.628 V (divider 2.713 V less 20 uA's drop); held LOW 0.266 V (divider 0.181 V plus 20 uA's rise)
  worst held HIGH 2.547 V: margin over VIH 2.0 V 0.547 V; over the enables' highest ON threshold (1.29 V) 1.257 V
  worst held LOW 0.266 V: margin under VIL 0.8 V 0.534 V; under the enables' lowest OFF threshold (0.55 V) 0.284 V
  the panel overriding the keeper: 0.70 mA to drive against a held output, 0.66 mA to sink a held high, both under the pad's 4 mA default drive: OK
  the panel's drive seen by the gate and the enables: high at least 2.62 V (margin 0.62 V over VIH), low at most 0.5 V (margin 0.30 V under VIL)

